cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sinon: an AI agent pentest kit"
message: "If you use Sinon in research or in a published assessment, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: at0m-b0mb
    name: at0m-b0mb
repository-code: "https://github.com/at0m-b0mb/Sinon"
url: "https://at0m-b0mb.github.io/Sinon/"
abstract: >-
  Sinon is a methodology and test corpus for assessing LLM agents against prompt
  injection, tool abuse and over-permissioned actions. Verdicts rest on observed
  facts --- unique canaries returned by the agent, instrumented tool calls, and
  requests arriving at a loopback sink --- rather than on a judge model. Probes
  that a target cannot answer are reported as skipped rather than passed, and
  reduce a coverage-capped grade.
keywords:
  - security
  - large language models
  - agents
  - prompt injection
  - penetration testing
  - OWASP LLM Top 10
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
